#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:1
msgid "Synthesize your first spectrum"
msgstr "合成你的第一条光谱"

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:3
msgid "Three parts of information is needed to synthesize a spectrum:"
msgstr "要合成一条光谱，通常需要三类信息："

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:4
msgid "Stellar atmosphere model;"
msgstr "恒星大气模型；"

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:5
msgid "Stellar parameters;"
msgstr "恒星参数；"

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:6
msgid "Line list."
msgstr "谱线表。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:8
msgid "The first two can be handeled in PySME:"
msgstr "前两部分都可以直接在 PySME 中设置："

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:19
msgid ""
"Here we defined effective temperature `teff`, surface gravity `logg`, "
"metallicity `monh`, and solar [chemical "
"abundance](../concepts/abundance.md) `abund`. For a full list of stellar "
"parameters, see [](../concepts/sme_struct.md)."
msgstr ""
"这里我们定义了有效温度 `teff`、表面重力 `logg`、金属丰度 `monh`，以及太阳[化学丰度]"
"(../concepts/abundance.md) `abund`。更完整的恒星参数列表可见 "
"[SME structure](../concepts/sme_struct.md)。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:22
msgid ""
"LineList can be download from [VALD database](https://vald.astro.uu.se/)."
" Here we provide an example line list: "
"[sun.lin](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SpectroscopyMadeEasy/PySME/master/examples/sun.lin)."
" Load the line list using:"
msgstr ""
"谱线表可以从 [VALD database](https://vald.astro.uu.se/) 下载。这里给出一个示例谱线表："
"[sun.lin](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SpectroscopyMadeEasy/PySME/master/examples/sun.lin)。"
"加载方式如下："

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:30
msgid "Define wavelength grid or wavelength range of the synthetic spectrum:"
msgstr "然后定义合成光谱的波长网格，或者直接给出波长范围："

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:38
msgid "Then use the `synthesize_spectrum` function:"
msgstr "接着调用 `synthesize_spectrum`："

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:44
msgid "The synthesized spectra are stored in `sme.wave` and `sme.synth`:"
msgstr "合成结果会保存在 `sme.wave` 和 `sme.synth` 中："

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:50
msgid "and can be plot by (for example):"
msgstr "你可以用例如下面的方式作图："

#: ../../getting_started/first_spectrum.md:58
msgid ""
"`[0]` is required because PySME stores spectra as segments; here the "
"result is recognized as segment 0."
msgstr "`[0]` 是必须的，因为 PySME 以 segment 的形式存储光谱；在这个例子里，结果被识别为第 0 个 segment。"
